  metaTitle: "Best Airbnb Coaching Alternatives -- Why Done-for-You Wins | BnB Accelerator Reviews",
  metaDescription: "Airbnb coaching programs teach you what to do but leave you to do the work. We explain why done-for-you STR investing delivers better outcomes for busy professionals.",
  excerpt: "Coaching programs give you knowledge. Done-for-you services give you results. Here is why the gap between learning and implementing is where most STR investors fail.",
